#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Bot Management is the admin window for creating, inspecting, enabling, and maintaining server-side bots. Open it from Tools > Bot Management, the Start menu Admin group, the toolbar Options dropdown, or by typing /bot with no arguments as an admin or server operator. It opens as a desktop window you can drag, resize, minimize to the taskbar, and close with its title-bar X."
